      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ROMEO.\nIs it even so? Then I defy you, stars!\nThou know’st my lodging. Get me ink and paper,\nAnd hire post-horses. I will hence tonight.",
